[[ ^5 ]]: Aperghis, G. G. (2004). [[ //The Seleukid Royal Economy: The Finances and Financial Administration of the Seleukid Empire// | https://books.google.com/books?id=39aLI4nkDqUC&pg=PA37 ]]. Oxford: Oxford University Press. pp. 37–38. ISBN [[ 9781139456135 | https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Special%3ABookSources%2F9781139456135 ]].

[[ ^6 ]]: Joseph Jacobs; Schulim Ochser. [[ "Seleucia (Talmud, "Selik," "Selika," "Selikos," Ket. 10b, Mak. 10a; Targum, "Salwaḳia," "Salwaḳya"; Greek, Σελεύκεια)" | http://www.jewishencyclopedia.com/view.jsp?artid=451&letter=S ]]. //Jewish Encyclopedia//.

[[ ^7 ]]: [[ //The History of the Decline and Fall of the Roman Empire//, by Edward Gibbon | https://web.archive.org/web/20080505055518/http://ebooks.adelaide.edu.au/g/gibbon/edward/g43d/chapter8.html#fn8.37 ]]

